          <a href="#assess" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Assess Your Cracks</a>
          <a href="#filling" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Filling the Cracks</a>
